(7421625, 1171036, 30214, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Lydia:</b></div><hr/><i> I think the modern tennis shoes threw off your score.   Although, they shouldn''t have... since the topic is about old ways... not that they aren''t done still today.   *sigh* </i></td></tr></table> Thank you, Lydia. Of course I saw the anachronism between the snickers and the rest of the costume, for me it was amusing. I have a thousand other photos where everything matches nicely, but I decided to go with this one :). Ah, the hell with the score :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Lydia: I think the modern tennis shoes threw off your score.   Although, they shouldn''t have... since the topic is about old ways... not that they aren''t done still today.   *sigh*  Thank you, Lydia. Of course I saw the anachronism between the snickers and the rest of the costume, for me it was amusing. I have a thousand other photos where everything matches nicely, but I decided to go with this one :). Ah, the hell with the score :)', '2015-12-10 01:55:30.000000', NULL, 0),
